1. Introduction
This report documents the exploration and testing of the ReqRes API using Postman. The purpose of the exercise was to understand API endpoints, authentication, HTTP methods, environment variables, automated scripts, response tests, and collection execution.
2. API Selection and Overview
The selected API is ReqRes, using the base URL https://reqres.in/api. ReqRes provides CRUD-style endpoints that are useful for demonstrating HTTP requests and testing expected API responses. The classic /api/users endpoints are demo/testing fixtures, so CRUD requests demonstrate the expected HTTP responses rather than persistent database changes.
Base URL: https://reqres.in/api
